// Test source location information in diagnostics when the offset is beyond the
// original file size (as source location handling is sensitive to file sizes).
//
// Note: The column number is (unfortunately) the post-conversion byte offset.
//
// Input files were converted using `uconv -f UTF-8 -t IBM1047_LF`.

// diag-input-charset-offset-beyond-original-filesize.c:
// ```
// int éé = 0;<U+0085>
// ```

// RUN: %clang_cc1 -finput-charset IBM-1047 %S/Inputs/diag-input-charset-ibm1047-offset-beyond-original-filesize.c 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: {{.*}}/Inputs/diag-input-charset-ibm1047-offset-beyond-original-filesize.c:1:14: warning: treating Unicode character as whitespace [-Wunicode-whitespace]
